      "content": "got it, i'll make sure to get the galvanized hardware and better screws. one more thing, i'm worried about the stability of the whole thing if the soil starts shifting or if there's a lot of vibration. what are the biggest red flags that suggest a deck's foundation or structural integrity is failing?",
